' The nearby target at the keyboard (`preset classic ai none seed 3 start 30`,
' Paradise Camp). Beside the tent, in fight mode: Tab targets the door; Space
' goes back to speak mode and enters it (`OnMenuSpeak`, `OnClickEntrance`).
' A click is the mouse again: the target goes until the next key.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 110,122         ' into Paradise Camp
wait 60
mapclick 177,165         ' beside the tent
wait 80
fight
press tab                ' target: door Tent
press space              ' speak mode, and into the tent
wait 120
quit
